{"id":"u-89f13842-4275-492c-88a3-5fc364a0cf06","src":"community","title":"Start Strong 4 day Beginner Program","author":"Herland Bjørnsbror","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/LMhdoz-boostcamp4dayworkoutprogram","desc":"This 4-day beginner strength program is built for people who are getting back into training or starting from a low fitness base. The program uses a balanced upper/lower split, training each major muscle group twice per week while keeping each session simple and manageable.\n\nThe focus is on learning good technique, building consistency, and progressing gradually without training to failure. Each workout combines compound movements, accessory exercises, and basic core work to help develop strength, muscle, stability, and general fitness over time.\n\nThis is not a quick-fix program. It is designed as a repeatable weekly routine that can be followed for several weeks while slowly increasing reps, weight, and confidence in the gym.","level":["Beginner"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-06-17T23:31:34.081Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper A","Lower A","Upper B","Lower B"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Plank","sets":[{"sec":20,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10